# The two rules (highest priority)

1. **NEVER ADD ANYTHING ON YOUR OWN.** No features, UI, labels, status text, or "improvements" beyond the exact ask. Deliver exactly what was requested — nothing extra.
2. **NEVER REMOVE ANYTHING ON YOUR OWN.** Never delete, comment out, disable, or hide features, UI, tests, or checks. If something is broken, the only path is to iterate — grind for hours if needed — until it is fixed.

If the ask seems to require adding or removing something the user did not mention, stop and ask first.
